%% Candidate discovery — adopted owner-amended baseline; unresolved parameters remain in the Open Decisions register.
flowchart TD
  Universe[Point-in-time eligible universe] --> Screen[Cheap quality / quantitative screens]
  Screen --> Pod[Shared Strategies port / version and horizon]
  Pod --> Dedup[Candidate identity / deduplication]
  Dedup --> Discovered[DISCOVERED]
  Discovered --> Triage[TRIAGED: priority / expiry / budget]
  Triage --> Analysis[ANALYZING]
  Analysis --> Proposed[PROPOSED]
  Triage --> Filtered[FILTERED: policy or no-trade]
  Analysis --> Filtered
  Triage --> Expired[EXPIRED]
  Analysis --> Expired
  Analysis --> Failed[FAILED: technical outcome]
  Proposed --> Portfolio[Portfolio workflow]
  Filtered --> Shadow[Eligible registered shadow policy]
